      "body": "Fixes #61208.\n\nExpand list/tuple cache entries into all their tensor views, preventing secondary views from being omitted. Keep storage registration and region deduplication; introduce no new KV allocation or data copy.\n\nAdd two regression tests covering list/tuple, shared/separate storage, last-block descriptors and padded-state deduplication. Isolated CPU harness: baseline 1 passed / 4 failed, patched 5 passed.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull Request Checklist</summary>\n\n- [x] Used vLLM's `pr-checklist` skill.\n- [x] AI assistance was used during this contribution.\n- [x] Design Fit: scoped to Store registration; no new KV allocation, data copy or dependency.\n- [x] Testing and Validation: added regression tests; five isolated CPU regression cases passed.\n- [x] Code Quality and Style: Ruff check, format and diff checks passed.\n- [x] Pull Request Contents: linked the reproducer issue and described the change and test results.\n\nValidation scope: the CPU harness is not full vLLM pytest. Full pytest has not been rerun; upstream CI awaits the maintainer-controlled gate.\n\n</details>",
